/- English proof (translation)
Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Introduce a local definition for the expression. Establish an intermediate fact. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. By extensionality, compare the relevant components.

Establish an intermediate fact. Simplify using the standard rewrite rules. Establish an intermediate fact. Establish an intermediate fact. Rewrite the indicated hypotheses using the stated equalities.

Apply function extensionality and compare values at an arbitrary argument. Reduce the claim to the hypotheses of an applicable result. Apply function extensionality and compare values at an arbitrary argument. Simplify to obtain the desired conclusion from the available facts. A detailed English derivation is pending.
